    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Barry Auctioneers & Valuers are delighted to bring to the market for sale this beautiful two bedroom ground floor apartment situated in the hugely sought after Harbour Heights development in Passage West.\r\n\r\nThe property is in immaculate condition throughout, having been really well maintained and cared for by its current owners. It has a nice bright modern finish and is available for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nIt is most conveniently located within walking distance to all amenities and services in Passage West and is just a short drive to Douglas, Ringaskiddy, Cork City Centre & Cork Airport. It also has the benefit of having a regular public bus service available at the entrance to the park.\r\n\r\nViewing of this ideal starter home or investment property comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Kitchen - 3.5m x 1.9m \r\nTile floor, fitted kitchen unit with integrated oven, hob, dishwasher, overhead extractor unit, tile splashback, recessed lighting, fitted shelving.\n\r\n\r\nHallway - \r\nCarpet flooring, centre light, hot press with shelving.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom - 3.5m x 3.0m \r\nCarpet floor, built-in wardrobe unit, fitted shelving, centre light, curtain pole, curtains.\r\n\r\nEn Suite - 1.91m x 1.75m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, centre globe light, WC, WHB with wall shelf and wall mirror, shower unit with chrome enclosure.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.4m x 2.16m \r\nCarpet floor, centre light, built in wardrobe unit, fitted shelving, curtain pole, curtains.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.96m x 2.17m \r\nTile floor, centre globe light, fitted shelving, bath unit with overhead shower and tile surround, WC, WHB, wall cabinet with mirror.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Gas Fired Central Heating\r\nQuiet cul de sac location\r\n2 Double bedrooms\r\nBus Stop right outside the estate\r\nDirectly opposite Aldi & Bean & Leaf Cafe in Passage West\r\nReady for immediate occupation\r\nManagement Fee: €1,600.00 per annum\r\nClose to all local amenities , schools and services in Passage West"
      },
      {
